    "html": "<p>Hiring domestic help in India should be a structured process, not a desperate scramble when your current maid doesn't show up. Whether you're hiring for the first time or replacing someone who left, this comprehensive checklist ensures you make the right choice.</p><h2>Before You Start — Define Your Needs</h2><ul><li>☐ <strong>What tasks do you need help with?</strong> (cleaning, cooking, childcare, elderly care, all of the above)</li><li>☐ <strong>How many hours per day?</strong> (2-4 part-time / 8-12 full-time / live-in)</li><li>☐ <strong>What's your monthly budget?</strong> (research local rates for your city)</li><li>☐ <strong>Language preference?</strong> (Hindi, regional language, English basics)</li><li>☐ <strong>Timing preference?</strong> (morning slot, evening slot, flexible)</li><li>☐ <strong>Any special requirements?</strong> (cooking style, pet-friendly, experience with infants/elderly)</li></ul><h2>During Hiring — Verification</h2><ul><li>☐ <strong>Aadhaar card verified</strong> (original seen, number cross-checked)</li><li>☐ <strong>Police verification completed</strong> (or hire through a service like MyBuddyMaid that handles this)</li><li>☐ <strong>2+ previous employer references called</strong></li><li>☐ <strong>Address noted</strong> (permanent + current)</li><li>☐ <strong>Photograph taken</strong></li><li>☐ <strong>Emergency contact collected</strong></li></ul><h2>Setting Up — Agreement & Expectations</h2><ul><li>☐ <strong>Task list agreed</strong> (specific daily and weekly duties)</li><li>☐ <strong>Working hours confirmed</strong> (start time, end time)</li><li>☐ <strong>Salary agreed</strong> (amount, payment date, payment method)</li><li>☐ <strong>Weekly off decided</strong> (which day, 4 days per month minimum)</li><li>☐ <strong>Festival holidays listed</strong> (Diwali, Eid, regional festivals)</li><li>☐ <strong>Notice period agreed</strong> (15 days is standard)</li><li>☐ <strong>Trial period set</strong> (7 days for full-time/live-in, 3 days for part-time)</li><li>☐ <strong>Written agreement signed</strong> by both parties</li></ul><h2>First Week — Trial Period</h2><ul><li>☐ <strong>Show them your home</strong> — room by room, explain what goes where</li><li>☐ <strong>Explain your family's routine</strong> — wake time, meal times, kids' schedules</li><li>☐ <strong>Demonstrate cleaning products</strong> — which cleaner for which surface</li><li>☐ <strong>Set clear no-go zones</strong> — study, safe, personal drawers</li><li>☐ <strong>Evaluate punctuality</strong> — arrived on time every day?</li><li>☐ <strong>Evaluate work quality</strong> — thorough or rushed?</li><li>☐ <strong>Evaluate attitude</strong> — responsive to feedback? Initiative?</li></ul><h2>Ongoing — Management Best Practices</h2><ul><li>☐ <strong>Pay on time</strong> — same date every month, preferably bank transfer/UPI</li><li>☐ <strong>Annual increment</strong> — 10-15% raise keeps good help motivated</li><li>☐ <strong>Festival bonus</strong> — one month's salary at Diwali/Eid</li><li>☐ <strong>Treat with respect</strong> — use their name, provide tea/water, never shout</li><li>☐ <strong>Provide sick leave</strong> — 1-2 paid sick days per month is reasonable</li><li>☐ <strong>Address issues early</strong> — don't let small irritations build into big conflicts</li><li>☐ <strong>Have a backup plan</strong> — MyBuddyMaid's replacement guarantee covers this</li></ul><div class=\"seo-cta\"><h3>Skip the Checklist — MyBuddyMaid Handles Everything</h3><p>From verification to matching to ongoing support — we manage the entire process. All you do is approve and enjoy a well-run home.</p><a href=\"/app\" class=\"btn btn-primary\">Book Now</a></div><h2>Related Guides</h2>"
